lendar Campus Map Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Search Keywords Search Career Success Center Preparing every student for the career of their choice. Make an Appointment Attend an Event Menu Career Success Center news Events Student Resources Student Resources Services Symplicity Job Search Support Resumes & Cover Letters Career & Internship Fairs Career Exploration Assessment Blackboard Learning Lounge Employer Resources Employer Resources Hire a Bearkat Sponsorship Program Policies & Procedures Workshops & Presentations Our Mission people Connecting students and alumni to employers We are committed to empowering students and alumni in their careers. Through one-on-one appointments, we provide personalized support with resumes, mock interviews, job search strategies, headshots, and more. To further enhance career readiness, we host a variety of workshops throughout the year that address key professional development topics. We also create direct connections to future opportunities by organizing career and internship fairs, employer spotlights, on-campus interviews, and tabling events. Whether you're preparing to enter the workforce or planning your next step, our goal is to support your success with accessible, high-impact services designed to help you grow confidently and professionally. Services We offer many in-person and virtual services to meet students where they are. Learn how to schedule an appointment or request a presentation by visiting our Services page. Resume & Cover Letter Critique Bring your resume/cover letter for feedback or learn how to create one. Job & Internship Search Discuss ways to find jobs and internships related to your field. Career Exploration & Planning Discover your strengths, interests, and goals with tailored support. Mock Interview Improve your interview skills and receive personalized feedback. LinkedIn Profile Setup Create your own LinkedIn profile and learn how to network with employers. Headshots Take a professional photo in our studio. Only available during headshot events. Workshops Request a presentation for your class or organization. Multiple career-related topics are available. Symplicity Now Available! Build your profile, find jobs, and access exclusive resources, all in once place. Get Started Attend a Career Fair Connect with employers, explore opportunities, and jumpstart your future. All majors are welcome. Get Hired Upcoming Events Contact the CSC Visit Address: Academic Building IV, Suite 210 1921 Avenue J, Huntsville, TX 77340 Hours: M–F | 8 AM–5 PM Google Maps Link Email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call 936-294-4454 Connect Sam Houston State University 1905 University Avenue Huntsville, TX 77340 936-294-1111 | 866-BEARKAT Policies Employee & Department Search Title IX Site Policies/Additional Links State of Texas Mental Health Counseling Texas Homeland Security TRAIL Fraud Reporting Hotline State Auditor’s Office Hotline Site Directory KatSafe Jobs Open Records Requests The measure of a life is its service"
    },
