 Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Search Keywords Search News Exclusive insights and success stories. Menu Career Success Center news Events Student Resources Student Resources Services Symplicity Job Search Support Resumes & Cover Letters Career & Internship Fairs Career Exploration Assessment Blackboard Learning Lounge Employer Resources Employer Resources Hire a Bearkat Sponsorship Program Policies & Procedures Workshops & Presentations Our Mission people Bearkats GOT Hired Featuring SHSU’s industry leaders. Submit a Success Story Bearkat Student Doctors Lead Again: SHSU-COM Tops the Nation on COMLEX-USA Level 1 SHSU-COM has once again earned national distinction, achieving the highest first-time pass rate in the country on the COMLEX-USA Level 1 board exam, administered by the National Board of Osteopathic Medical Examiners. Aspire  |  How SHSU Makes Dreams Come True Two talented Sam Houston State University graphic design students are seeing their dreams come true. Parker Marley and Kira Wygle are making the exciting transition from students to professional design interns at Walt Disney World Resort in Orlando, Florida. Soaring With Heart  |  SHSU Alumni Shine at Southwest Airlines Nearly two decades after graduating from SHSU, Dan Landson and Erin Barnard McCann have found purpose and pride in their work at Southwest Airlines. As communications professionals, they craft stories that celebrate connection, kindness, and the power of authentic storytelling—showing how Bearkats continue to soar far beyond campus. Contact the CSC Visit Address: Academic Building IV, Suite 210 1921 Avenue J, Huntsville, TX 77340 Hours: M–F | 8 AM–5 PM Google Maps Link Email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call 936-294-4454 Connect Sam Houston State University 1905 University Avenue Huntsville, TX 77340 936-294-1111 | 866-BEARKAT Policies Employe