    "https://www.shsu.edu/offices-departments/career-success-center/student-resources/index.php": {
      "title": "Student Resources",
      "description": "Student Resources Skip to main content About Alumni Athletics Giving News Tools & Support Open Search Tools Blackboard Email My Sam SamWeb SHSU Intranet Newton Gresham Library Academic Calendar Site Directory Events Calendar Campus Map Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Academics Academics Where hands-on learning meets real-world skills, success follows. Find what you want to study or explore all your academic opportunities. Majors & Programs Colleges SHSU Online Graduate Studies Honors College Research Admissions Admissions Select the type of student you are to get information on deadlines, requirements, and next steps for applying to SHSU. Freshman Transfer Graduate International SamPoly Accepted Students Cost & Aid Cost & Aid Find out how much it costs to attend SHSU and the variety of financial aid options available to help you pay for it. Cost of Attendance Student Account Services Types of Aid Bearkat Promise Frequently Asked Questions Campus Life Campus Life Explore what it’s like to live on campus at SHSU, from where you’ll live and eat to activities you can take part in outside of class. Housing Clubs & Organizations Greek Life Recreation & Fitness Dining Visit Apply Request Info Tools & Support Open Search Academics Academics Majors & Programs Colleges SHSU Online Graduate Studies Honors College Research Admissions Admissions Freshman Transfer Graduate International SamPoly Accepted Students Cost & Aid Cost & Aid Cost of Attendance Student Account Services Types of Aid Bearkat Promise Frequently Asked Questions Campus Life Campus Life Housing Clubs & Organizations Greek Life Recreation & Fitness Dining Visit Apply Request Info About Alumni Athletics Giving News Back Open Search Tools Blackboard Email My Sam SamWeb SHSU Intranet Newton Gresham Library Academic Calendar Site Directory Events Calendar Campus Map Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Search Keywords Search Student Resources Your career journey starts here. Access tools, events, and personalized support to build your resume, explore careers, and connect with employers. Menu Career Success Center news Events Student Resources Student Resources Services Symplicity Job Search Support Resumes & Cover Letters Career & Internship Fairs Career Exploration Assessment Blackboard Learning Lounge Employer Resources Employer Resources Hire a Bearkat Sponsorship Program Policies & Procedures Workshops & Presentations Our Mission people Launch Your Career with Confidence Whether you’re exploring career options, preparing your resume, or searching for internships and jobs, the SHSU Career Success Center has the tools and support you need. Start with Career Services From one-on-one career coaching to resume reviews and mock interviews, our Career Services are built to support you through every stage of your college-to-career journey. We’ll help you clarify your goals and take action toward them with confidence. Learn more on our Services page. Meet Employers at Career Fairs Our Career and Internship Fairs are your chance to connect with recruiters, explore job opportunities, and practice professional communication. We host fairs for all majors, plus industry-specific events throughout the year. Get details on our Career & Internship Fairs page. Build a Strong Resume & Cover Letter Crafting your first resume or fine-tuning a cover letter? We’ve got resources, templates, and expert tips to help you highlight your experience and land interviews. Start building on our Resumes & Cover Letters page. Explore Your Career Path Not sure what to major in or what career fits you best? Our Career Exploration Assessment (FOCUS 2) is a powerful tool that matches your interests and strengths to SHSU majors and career paths. Take it by visiting our Career Exploration Assessment page. Tap Into the Blackboard Learning Lounge Get 24/7 access to job postings, resources, and career readiness modules in our Blackboard Learning Lounge, a virtual space created by and for Bearkats. Access it through our Blackboard Learning Lounge page. Have Questions? We’re Here to Help! Schedule a meeting with your Career Coach or stop by the Career Success Center. Whether you’re a freshman or alum, we’re here to support your success. Email us at careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call us at 936-294-4454 Contact the CSC Visit Address: Academic Building IV, Suite 210 1921 Avenue J, Huntsville, TX 77340 Hours: M–F | 8 AM–5 PM Google Maps Link Email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call 936-294-4454 Connect Sam Houston State University 1905 University Avenue Huntsville, TX 77340 936-294-1111 | 866-BEARKAT Policies Employee & Department Search Title IX Site Policies/Additional Links State of Texas Mental Health Counseling Texas Homeland Security TRAIL Fraud Reporting Hotline State Auditor’s Office Hotline Site Directory KatSafe Jobs Open Records Requests The measure of a life is its service"
    },
