dar Campus Map Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Search Keywords Search Job Search Support Navigating the job market can be tough, but you don’t have to do it alone. Explore these top resources designed to help you land your dream job. Menu Career Success Center news Events Student Resources Student Resources Services Symplicity Job Search Support Resumes & Cover Letters Career & Internship Fairs Career Exploration Assessment Blackboard Learning Lounge Employer Resources Employer Resources Hire a Bearkat Sponsorship Program Policies & Procedures Workshops & Presentations Our Mission people Bearkat Exclusives Appointments Personalized help for students & alumni. Career & Internship Fairs Recruiters searching for SHSU talent. LinkedIn Group Connect with Bearkats, recruiters, and employers on our official network. Updated daily! Blackboard Learning Lounge Access on-demand workshops, videos, and modules 24/7. Available for undergraduate students. Micro-Internships Take short-term, paid projects from real employers to build skills and experience with Parker Dewey . Explore DEVELOP Skills, a Session at a Time Master every stage of your job search with video guides, templates, and strategies. BECOME AN EXPERT Connect, Apply, Get Hired On-Campus Employment Discover student worker positions, graduate assistantships, and full-time opportunities at SHSU. Work @ Sam LinkedIn Build your professional profile, connect with employers, and explore job listings. LOCK-IN ON LINKEDIN Indeed A major job board with openings across industries and experience levels. Browse tailored opportunities and career resources. FIND WHAT YOU NEED, ON INDEED ZipRecruiter Get matched to jobs and communicate directly with hiring managers. Get Recruited Monster Search jobs, post your resume, and get career advice. Job hunt? Scary easy Discover the Right Path for You Glassdoor Read company reviews, view salary information, and explore job openings. O*Net Online Research detailed career profiles, skill requirements, and outlooks. U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics Explore job projections, salary data, and career insights by field. Symplicity Now Available! Build your profile, find jobs, and access exclusive resources, all in one place. GET STARTED Contact the CSC Visit Address: Academic Building IV, Suite 210 1921 Avenue J, Huntsville, TX 77340 Hours: M–F | 8 AM–5 PM Google Maps Link Email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call 936-294-4454 Connect Sam Houston State University 1905 University Avenue Huntsville, TX 77340 936-294-1111 | 866-BEARKAT Policies Employee & Department Search Title IX Site Policies/Additional Links State of Texas Mental Health Counseling Texas Homeland Security TRAIL Fraud Reporting Hotline State Auditor’s Office Hotline Site Directory KatSafe Jobs Open Records Requests The measure of a life is its service"
