Calendar Campus Map Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Search Keywords Search Resumes & Cover Letters Build standout resumes and cover letters with our tips, templates, and tools. Make a strong first impression and take the next step in your career journey. Menu Career Success Center news Events Student Resources Student Resources Services Symplicity Job Search Support Resumes & Cover Letters Career & Internship Fairs Career Exploration Assessment Blackboard Learning Lounge Employer Resources Employer Resources Hire a Bearkat Sponsorship Program Policies & Procedures Workshops & Presentations Our Mission people From Draft to Job Offer, We’ve Got You Covered Our resume templates are ATS-friendly and designed to help you make a strong impression. Before submitting your resume, we recommend having at least two people review it. Including a tailored cover letter can also help you stand out as a top candidate. Current students and alumni can receive personalized resume critiques from our career coaches by emailing careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu or scheduling an appointment . Please allow 3–5 business days for email reviews. Additional templates and guides are available at the Career Success Center or in the Blackboard Learning Lounge for undergraduate students. Templates General Resume Teaching Resume Nursing Resume Federal Resume Cover Letter Contact the CSC Visit Address: Academic Building IV, Suite 210 1921 Avenue J, Huntsville, TX 77340 Hours: M–F | 8 AM–5 PM Google Maps Link Email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call 936-294-4454 Connect Sam Houston State University 1905 University Avenue Huntsville, TX 77340 936-294-1111 | 866-BEARKAT Policies Employee & Department Search Title IX Site Policies/Additional Links State of Texas Mental Health Counseling Texas Homeland Security TRAIL Fraud Reporting Hotline State Auditor’s Office Hotline Site Directory KatSafe Jobs Open Records Requests The measure of a life is its service"
