vents Calendar Campus Map Support Academic Success Center Career Success Center First-Generation Center SAM Center Services for Students with Disabilities Student Health Center Student Money Management Search Keywords Search Career Exploration Assessment Explore majors and careers that fit your strengths with the FOCUS 2 assessment. Gain clarity and confidence in planning your future path. Menu Career Success Center news Events Student Resources Student Resources Services Symplicity Job Search Support Resumes & Cover Letters Career & Internship Fairs Career Exploration Assessment Blackboard Learning Lounge Employer Resources Employer Resources Hire a Bearkat Sponsorship Program Policies & Procedures Workshops & Presentations Our Mission people What is FOCUS 2? A reliable, user-friendly career and education planning tool that helps you choose SHSU majors, explore occupations, and make informed decisions. Its modern design actively engages you in the career planning process, empowering lifelong success. New Users Register and create a FOCUS 2 account. Access code: bearkat Register Returning Users Access your account anytime by entering your username and password on the log in page. If you forget your credentials, you can have them emailed via the link below. Log In Keep in Mind Use FOCUS 2 on any device, anytime, anywhere. Your results are automatically saved and always accessible. Revisit sections, explore new options, and revise earlier choices. Results are available to both you and your career coach. Save majors and occupations that interest you while reviewing. The main menu mirrors the career planning process. Most students start at the top and work their way down. Contact the CSC Visit Address: Academic Building IV, Suite 210 1921 Avenue J, Huntsville, TX 77340 Hours: M–F | 8 AM–5 PM Google Maps Link Email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu Call 936-294-4454 Connect Sam Houston State University 1905 University Avenue Huntsville, TX 77340 936-294-1111 | 866-BEARKAT Policies Employee & Department Search Title IX Site Policies/Additional Links State of Texas Mental Health Counseling Texas Homeland Security TRAIL Fraud Reporting Hotline State Auditor’s Office Hotline Site Directory KatSafe Jobs Open Records Requests The measure of a life is its service"
    },
