      "description": "SHSU Career Success Center (@shsucareers) / X Log in Sign up SHSU Career Success Center 4,239 posts SHSU Career Success Center @shsucareers Helping students & alumni land their dream jobs! 🚀 #BearkatsGetHired 🤝💰 Huntsville, TX beacons.ai/shsucareers Joined August 2009 111 Following 1,572 Followers Mention Follow Posts Posts Replies Replies Reposts Reposts Media Media Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Terms · Privacy · Cookies · Accessibility · US TIDA · Ads Info · More © 2026 X Corp. SHSU Career Success Center @shsucareers Jan 8 Student-athletes, mark your calendars! 🗓️\n\nJoin us for the Bearkat Athletes Career Fair this month & connect with employers offering jobs/internships.\n\n📅 Jan. 24, 2026\n🕚 11 AM–2 PM\n📍 @ SHSULSC Orange Ballroom\n\nRSVP on @ SymplicityCorp 🔽 shsu-csm.symplicity.com/events/SP26Ath… 54 SHSU Career Success Center @shsucareers Dec 25, 2025 Merry Christmas! 🎄🎁 00:00 23 SHSU Career Success Center @shsucareers Dec 16, 2025 Being a student-athlete builds you physically and professionally. 💪📈 @ BearkatsTFXC alum and aspiring healthcare professional Mitchell Hackstedt is proof. 💯 He shares how his journey opened doors beyond the field and instilled a strong work ethic. 👏 #StudentAthlete 00:00 23 SHSU Career Success Center @shsucareers Dec 11, 2025 From thoughtful coaching to facilitated learning, incoming graduate Victoria May made an incredible impact at the @ SHSUASC ! 🎓💫\n\nWorking on campus really does level up your qualifications. Proud of you, Victoria! 👏🔥 #StudentWorker | #SHSU 00:00 1 51 SHSU Career Success Center @shsucareers Dec 10, 2025 @ BearkatsFB needs interns to join their award-winning team! 🏈🏆\n\nPositions available:\n🔍 Recruiting\n🎨 Graphic Design\n🎥 Film\n🧰 Equipment\n\n… and more! ✅\n\nEmail Coach Kadum to apply 👇\n📧 [email protected] #BearkatsGetHired | #BearkatsSonContratados 1 22"
