    "https://www.linkedin.com/company/shsu-career-success-center/": {
      "title": "SHSU Career Success Center",
      "description": "SHSU Career Success Center | LinkedIn Skip to main content LinkedIn Top Content People Learning Jobs Games Sign in Join now SHSU Career Success Center Higher Education Huntsville, Texas 1,491 followers Helping students & alumni land their dream jobs! 🚀 Follow View all 6 employees Report this company About us The SHSU Career Success Center connects students and alumni with employers through resources, support, and personalized guidance.\n\nSome of our free in-person/online services include resume reviews, job searches, career exploration, and mock interviews. Website https://beacons.ai/shsucareers External link for SHSU Career Success Center Industry Higher Education Company size 10,001+ employees Headquarters Huntsville, Texas Type Educational Founded 1879 Locations Primary 1921 Avenue J Academic Building - Suite 210 Huntsville, Texas 77340, US Get directions Employees at SHSU Career Success Center Derwin Youngblood Corgan Smith Olivia Casas Luis Rodriguez See all employees Updates SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 2d Report this post With the internet, there's an infinite number of resources to improve your skills, but to keep it easy, here's 3 videos to improve critical thinking!\n\nDeveloping critical thinking skills helps you make better decisions in the workplace and lets you build well-thought answers to various questions.\n\n💡 Pro-Tip: Utilize LinkedIn Learning to develop new career skills. #BearkatsGetHired #SHSU #career #JobSearchTips 1 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 4d Report this post \"Take the T off of Can’t.\" From starting out on a teacher’s salary to leading A&C Plastics and entering the Texas Business Hall of Fame, Carolyn Faulk embodies resilience, lifelong learning, and the power of giving back.\n\nRead about her inspiring journey and advice for Bearkats! 🎓✨ #SHSUAlumni #CareerSuccess #BearkatPride #WomenInBusiness #AlumniSpotlight 1 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 5d Report this post Ready to take the next step toward your future?\n\nJoin us for the Fall 2026 Career & Internship Fair at the Lowman Student Center! Connect face-to-face with top employers recruiting for local, state, and national opportunities.\n\nField Focus Days:\n\n⚖ Day 1 (Oct. 6): Criminal Justice\n🔬 Day 2 (Oct. 7): Science & Engineering Technology\n💼 Day 3 (Oct. 8): Health Sciences, Arts & Media, Humanities & Social Sciences, and Business Administration\n\nEvent Details:\n\n- Time: 9:00 AM – 2:00 PM daily\n- Location: LSC Orange Ballroom\n\nHave questions or need help before the fair? Contact the Career Success Center at (936) 294-4454 or email careersuccesscenter@shsu.edu . #SHSU #Bearkats #CareerFair #InternshipFair #CareerSuccess 19 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center reposted this Mark Davis 1w Report this post What kind of a new servant leaders are you looking for at your company? If you're looking for smart, dedicated and service-oriented individuals, look no further than Sam Houston State University. \n\nI'm really excited to announce the next round of Fall Career Fairs here at Sam. These connector events will take place from 6-8 October and will encompass the majority of our colleges. If you are in my network, please reshare the attached photo with all of the pertinent information so we can grow the depth of regional and national businesses who attend.\n\nThis year should be really special with a reduced registration rate, free admission for non-profits and a surge in excitement about what is happening across the campus and the region. \n\nIn my honest opinion, SHSU Students deserve to be in successful academic and career pathways after college and it's all of our responsibilities to get them there!  Thanks for listening to my TED Talk...now get out the word! (please) David P. Glaser, Maj Gen US Army (Ret). , David Stender, Ph.D., CPP SHSU College of Business Administration , SHSU Young Alumni of Houston , SHSU Career Success Center , SHSU College of Business Administration , Sam Houston State University , SHSU Online , SHSU - Alumni Showcase Page , Chad Hargrave , Harriet Bynum , Courtney Wilson, PhD 21 1 Comment Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 1w Report this post Ready to get behind the scenes of Division I college football? \n\nSam Houston Football is now accepting applications for 2026 Game Day and Special Events Recruiting Volunteers! #SHSU #CareerSuccess #CareerGrowth #volunteer 3 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 1w Report this post Is your LinkedIn profile picture still a blurry selfie from three years ago?\n\nLet’s change that! Join us for Headshot Day and upgrade your professional brand with a free, high-quality headshot. Whether you're sprucing up your resume, preparing for job applications, or updating your digital presence, we’ve got you covered.\n\nWhere: TWC Rm 246\nWhen: September 30th | 9 AM - 4 PM\n\nMake an Appointment: https://lnkd.in/gPCfVWXq 3 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 1w Report this post Student Interns WANTED!\n\nEmail tjz008@shsu.edu to apply. 9 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 2w Report this post Welcome back Bearkats! We've missed you ☺️\n\nGood luck with your first day of classes! 🍀 3 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 2w Report this post The Career Success Center is proud to introduce our new Director Mark Davis. We are excited for Mark to join our team and connect with every Bearkat who comes through our office.\n\n\"I'm very excited to be back at Sam serving as the Career Success Center Director. Our goal here is to support the advancement of every student's academic and career success. Whether you are new here or in your last semester, I invite you to stop by to see what the Career Success Center has to offer in support of your post-graduation plans. Whether you considered it or not -- attaining a great career, moving forward in your education, or choosing service to country requires focused attention throughout your entire college experience. Come as you are -- leave informed & ready to take your next step. Have a great semester!\" - Colonel (Retired) Mark Davis 11 Like Comment Share SHSU Career Success Center 1,491 followers 3w Report this post Welcome Freshmen Bearkats! Looking to get your hands on some FREE swag?\n\nWhen you submit your resume to Symplicity OR score 70% or higher on the Career & Self-Development quiz, you can come to our office for a free shirt! This offer will expire August 24th, so do it while supplies last.\n\nSo, how will you decide to earn it?\n\nRULES:\n\n- Must be a SHSU freshman to participate\n- Must submit resume to Symplicity platform or achieve a 70% or higher test score on Knowledge Check: Career & Self-Development quiz in the Learning Lounge on Blackboard\n- Must claim reward in-person at AB IV Rm 210 (please show proof of completion) 1 Like Comment Share Join now to see what you are missing Find people you know at SHSU Career Success Center Browse recommended jobs for you View all updates, news, and articles Join now Affiliated pages SHSU - Career Success Center Employer Showcase Page Higher Education SHSU - Alumni Showcase Page Higher Education SHSU - Student Page Higher Education Similar pages SHSU College of Business Administration Higher Education Huntsville, Texas SHSU College of Criminal Justice Higher Education Huntsville, Texas Sam Houston State University - Engineering Technology Higher Education Huntsville, Texas College of Science and Engineering Technology Higher Education Huntsville, Texas SHSU College of Health Sciences Higher Education Huntsville, Texas SHSU College of Humanities and Social Sciences Higher Education Department of Accounting, SHSU Accounting Huntsville, Texas Sam Houston State University - Institute For Homeland Security Higher Education Huntsville, TX Homeland Security Student Association Higher Education 